<div class="page">

  <div class="header-row">
    <div class="page-number">16</div>
    <div>American Builder, July 1935.</div>
  </div>

  <div class="title">
    <span class="t1">KALMAN</span> <span class="t2">STEEL</span> <span class="t3">JOISTS</span>
  </div>

  <div class="illustration">
    <div class="placeholder main-illustration">
      [Illustration: A man in a suit standing behind four small model houses (two-story tudor style homes with trees), placing/arranging them on a table, ocean/horizon line visible in background]
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="tagline">bring added values to any home</div>

  <div class="columns">
    <div class="col">
      <p><span class="dropcap">While</span> fire-safety ranks first among the advantages of Kalman Steel Joists, they bring additional values that appeal to any prospective home-builder.</p>
      <p>The combination of Kalman Steel Joists with concrete floor slab and plaster makes a floor structure that, while forming an impassable barrier to fire, transmits very little sound and vibration, preventing noises overhead from disturbing occupants of rooms below. A floor structure that cannot shrink to cause cracks where walls and floor meet, and that is immune to the dreaded termite, whose ravages are spreading rapidly.</p>
      <p>These advantages, which make a difference in the building cost of only a few cents a square foot, provide the owner with a dwelling that is more</p>
    </div>
    <div class="col">
      <p>livable. They make his investment sounder, because his home&mdash;which often represents the savings of years&mdash;is less subject to swift obsolescence, will need fewer repairs.</p>
      <p>Kalman Steel Joists in no way complicate the builder's work. Often they simplify it. These joists require no cutting or fitting. They reach the site in the exact lengths needed and are quickly installed and the concrete poured.</p>
      <p>Tell the prospective home-owner about the advantages of Kalman Steel Joists. The fact that he may have</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="joist-row">
    <div class="joist-imgs">
      <div class="joist-block">
        <div class="joist-placeholder">[Photo: I-beam steel joist section]</div>
        <div class="joist-label">KALMAN JOIST</div>
      </div>
      <div class="joist-block">
        <div class="joist-placeholder">[Photo: open-web truss steel joist section]</div>
        <div class="joist-label">MACMAR JOIST</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="joist-text">
      in mind a relatively small dwelling offers no obstacle to their use. Kalman Joists can be applied as economically to a six-room home as to a large, pretentious one. They are of course adaptable to any style of architecture.
    </div>
  </div>

